1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,747
In a dead world of rusted steel and silence, a tiny scrap robot named Pip found the impossible.

2
00:00:06,747 --> 00:00:14,077
Buried beneath tons of cold iron was a single fragile sprout, glowing with bioluminescent green life.

3
00:00:14,077 --> 00:00:20,837
With gentle hands, Pip carried it to the highest peak, planting it into the rich earth at sunrise.

4
00:00:20,837 --> 00:00:26,747
And with one warm drop of devotion, life exploded across the gray horizon.

5
00:00:26,747 --> 00:00:34,259
A massive golden blossom erupted into the sky, covering the cold world in vibrant wildflowers and light.

6
00:00:34,259 --> 00:00:41,626
Proving that even in a world of rust, the smallest spark of love can bloom an entire universe.

